				28,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Expand provider type coverage to full VS Code surface\n\nCoordinate submodule updates across Common and Mountain to complete VS Code language server protocol provider alignment:\n\n- **Common**: Add 7 new ProviderType enum variants (InlineEdit, MappedEdits, MultiDocumentHighlight, NotebookContent, RemoteAuthorityResolver, ResourceLabelFormatter, ScmResourceGroup), bringing the total to 51 provider types.\n\n- **Mountain**: Add corresponding provider type handlers in MountainVinegRPCService to match Cocoon's complete VS Code API shim. New handlers cover authentication, SCM, resource labels, full notebook support, advanced editing features, debug infrastructure, and remote workspace features.\n\nThis expansion from ~25 to 50+ provider types enables extensions that register these previously-unhandled providers (e.g., GitLens, live share, remote tunnels) to activate successfully.\n\nRefs: b71ab93f22e526a1a9cc961706c66040fd2a9be6",
			"SHA": "a37647319ace9635d470212de20ffe2bb2fa4271"
		},
